# .claude/ is local config EXCEPT settings.json, which carries the TURN-1 primer gate.
# That gate is mandatory-every-session governance (AGENT.md → FIRST ENTRY POINT), so it must be
# versioned: unversioned, it reached no clone and no launched worker, and it had drifted three ways
# from AGENT.md with nothing to catch it (2026-07-31 — wrong primer filename, a retired `active`
# schema, and a `none` branch that said STOP where AGENT.md says proceed).
# NOTE the `/*` — git cannot re-include a file whose parent DIRECTORY is excluded, so `.claude/`
# plus `!.claude/settings.json` would silently not work.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
transcripts/
planning_runs/
node_modules/
dist/
coverage/
test-transcripts/
.npm-cache/
.agenttalk-supervisor.pid
/recordings/
google-oauth-client.json
google-drive-token.json
credentials.json

# vite build artifacts
apps/web/vite.config.js
apps/web/vite.config.js.map
persistence/
vitest.log
test-loop-debug.log

# TypeScript incremental build info
*.tsbuildinfo

# spike / smoke / live-probe run logs (evidence lives in the ledgers, not git)
m07-*.log

# BL-110 step 3 — pending approval tokens; deliberately NOT under design/operator/**
.approvals/
